// template: Warehouse
// order: 1
title "Warehouse"
tempo 138
key f minor

kick:   kick     hard     x... x... x... x... | gain 0.9
rumble: boom     dirty    . . f1 . . . f1 . . . f1 . . f1 . .                  | duck 0.9 | lowpass 400 | gain 0.6
acid:   acid     squelch  f2 f2 f3! f2 . f2 ab2 f2! / f2 . c3 f2 eb3! f2 . f2  | legato | cutoff saw(8) 250..3200 | resonance 0.85 | distort 0.35 | delay 3/16 | duck 0.4 | gain 0.7
hat:    hat      closed   . x . x . x . x . x . x . x x?0.6 x                  | gain 0.55 | pan -0.15
ohat:   hat      open     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.                                  | gain 0.45 | pan 0.15
clap:   clap     snap     .... x... .... x...                                  | reverb room | gain 0.9
snare:  snare    boom     .... .... .... ..xx | reverb small | gain 0.9
ride:   ride     wash     x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | pan 0.3 | gain 0.5
stab:   stab     rave     . . Fm . . . . . / . . . . Fm . . . / . . Dbmaj7 . . . . . / . . . . C . . .   | crush 0.25 | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | gain 0.6
lead:   lead     rave     f4 ~ ~ ~ ab4 ~ g4 ~ / f4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ . . / eb4 ~ ~ ~ f4 ~ c4 ~ / c4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ . .   | cutoff sine(16) 800..4000 | reverb plate | gain 0.9
chip:   square   chip     . . . . c5 . . . / . . ab4 . . . . . / . . . . c5 . bb4 . / . . f4 . . . . .   | delay 3/16 | reverb small | pan 0.25 | gain 0.3
rise:   noise    white    x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                  | cutoff saw(8) 300..9000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
crash:  crash    wide     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.6
impact: impact   metal    x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb room | gain 0.8

section intro  kick hat ride
section groove kick rumble hat ohat clap ride acid | loop
section build  kick hat clap snare acid stab rise
section break  acid stab lead chip
section drop   kick rumble hat ohat clap snare ride acid stab lead chip crash impact
section outro  kick hat ride

song intro 16, groove 32, build 8, break 16, build 8, drop 32, groove 16, outro 16
